WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.626
Safex

00:00:01.776 --> 00:00:06.845
Candy left The Merry Jane Nurse School
and headed towards St. Joanna hospital.

00:00:06.995 --> 00:00:09.703
Each day, she learns
how to be a good nurse.

00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:13.937
She has been through so much.

00:00:14.298 --> 00:00:15.591
And now

00:00:15.741 --> 00:00:18.494
one thing that will have
a huge impact on Candy's heart...

00:00:18.644 --> 00:00:21.361
...is about to happen.

00:00:21.511 --> 00:00:23.166
Attack!

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:42.550
Angels under the shadow of war

00:00:55.405 --> 00:00:56.632
Oh my god!

00:00:56.782 --> 00:00:58.066
What is it, Judy?

00:00:58.216 --> 00:00:59.535
Nurse troop!

00:00:59.685 --> 00:01:04.204
The troops are taking nurses along
to the European war zone.

00:01:05.516 --> 00:01:06.615
Europe?

00:01:08.151 --> 00:01:10.676
They will pick some nurses
to go with them.

00:01:11.889 --> 00:01:13.754
- Who is in?
- How many people?

00:01:14.057 --> 00:01:16.285
I am not sure about that.

00:01:16.435 --> 00:01:17.553
Could it be the five of us?

00:01:17.703 --> 00:01:20.189
I am not ready
to go to the front line.

00:01:20.339 --> 00:01:21.824
What should we do?

00:01:21.974 --> 00:01:23.892
What is wrong with you?

00:01:24.102 --> 00:01:27.898
Franny, aren't you scared?

00:01:28.438 --> 00:01:31.430
Nothing is decided yet, is it?

00:01:32.175 --> 00:01:33.469
You are right...

00:01:33.619 --> 00:01:35.535
So you have no reason to panic.

00:01:40.584 --> 00:01:42.778
Isn't Franny worried at all?

00:01:42.928 --> 00:01:45.881
No way, Franny must be scared.

00:01:46.031 --> 00:01:49.824
Yeah,
she was just pretending to be strong.

00:01:53.597 --> 00:01:55.531
Eleanor is right.

00:01:55.866 --> 00:01:57.966
Franny must be scared.

00:01:59.770 --> 00:02:01.430
- Candice!
- Yes!

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:04.266
Take this patient out for a walk.

00:02:04.416 --> 00:02:05.434
Yes.

00:02:05.584 --> 00:02:08.103
I am Marsha, thanks for that.

00:02:08.579 --> 00:02:10.439
I am Candice White.

00:02:10.589 --> 00:02:13.709
I'll catch with you later, Marsha.

00:02:13.859 --> 00:02:14.910
OK.

00:02:15.118 --> 00:02:17.146
Candice, please.

00:02:17.396 --> 00:02:18.447
Yes.

00:02:19.523 --> 00:02:21.081
Let's go.

00:02:28.431 --> 00:02:30.759
Do you know the head nurse?

00:02:31.602 --> 00:02:34.833
I used to be a nurse here.

00:02:35.806 --> 00:02:38.331
So you were our senior.

00:02:39.343 --> 00:02:41.504
It hasn't changed much.

00:02:50.387 --> 00:02:52.480
Why are you staying
in the surgical ward?

00:02:58.662 --> 00:03:01.631
I am sorry.

00:03:02.065 --> 00:03:04.727
That's alright, look!

00:03:07.638 --> 00:03:09.003
Prosthesis?

00:03:09.473 --> 00:03:12.033
Yes, I have only one leg left now.

00:03:13.276 --> 00:03:14.836
I have to blame the war for this.

00:03:14.986 --> 00:03:16.242
The war?

00:03:18.548 --> 00:03:22.712
I went to Europe along with the army.

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:24.846
In Europe?

00:03:25.396 --> 00:03:28.516
Yes,
I was attending the wounded on camp...

00:04:00.791 --> 00:04:04.086
But I volunteered for the front line.

00:04:04.236 --> 00:04:05.924
So I do not regret.

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:10.993
There are so many wounded and
sick people out there on the battlefield.

00:04:11.143 --> 00:04:13.764
Nurses are urgently needed.

00:04:13.970 --> 00:04:15.699
Come to think about it...

00:04:16.006 --> 00:04:19.203
I am very upset.

00:04:19.543 --> 00:04:20.936
I never imagined...

00:04:21.086 --> 00:04:24.773
...she is disabled.

00:04:24.923 --> 00:04:27.248
War is horrible.

00:04:27.918 --> 00:04:30.679
Miss Candy,
it's kind of breezy here.

00:04:30.829 --> 00:04:33.120
- Let's go back.
- Right.

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:48.438
Nurse troop?

00:04:49.239 --> 00:04:51.605
Who will go?

00:04:53.309 --> 00:04:56.069
Franny, are you sleeping?

00:04:59.382 --> 00:05:01.943
If we get picked,

00:05:02.093 --> 00:05:04.646
we will have to go
to the battlefield.

00:05:05.956 --> 00:05:08.984
I won't get to see Terry
for quite a while.

00:05:09.134 --> 00:05:12.187
No, maybe I can never see him again.

00:05:25.976 --> 00:05:30.079
Nurses are urgently needed.

00:05:37.987 --> 00:05:40.888
Isn't Franny worried at all?

00:05:41.458 --> 00:05:44.689
I just can't stay as calm as Franny.

00:05:51.968 --> 00:05:54.835
Shoot! I overslept.

00:05:55.571 --> 00:05:57.362
I couldn't sleep the whole night.

00:05:59.976 --> 00:06:01.671
Dim wit!

00:06:03.913 --> 00:06:05.871
Headmistress?

00:06:06.048 --> 00:06:07.575
As usual...

00:06:07.725 --> 00:06:11.677
You just can't stop running
on the hallways even when you are here.

00:06:11.988 --> 00:06:13.381
Sorry!

00:06:13.531 --> 00:06:15.983
Why are you here?

00:06:16.133 --> 00:06:17.423
Why?

00:06:18.027 --> 00:06:22.225
Didn't the principal tell you anything?

00:06:22.465 --> 00:06:24.459
What?

00:06:24.609 --> 00:06:27.603
Come with me if you want to know.

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:29.595
- I have a class...
- Forget it.

00:06:29.745 --> 00:06:31.331
Just come with me quietly.

00:06:34.377 --> 00:06:39.407
There must be a reason
why headmistress Mary Jane showed up...

00:06:39.557 --> 00:06:41.347
Nurse troop!

00:06:42.251 --> 00:06:44.779
But who will go?

00:06:44.929 --> 00:06:48.119
All of us? Or...

00:06:51.761 --> 00:06:53.626
Come in!

00:06:56.231 --> 00:06:58.131
Headmistress!

00:06:59.802 --> 00:07:01.429
How is everybody?

00:07:09.611 --> 00:07:12.106
This must be
about the nurse troop thing.

00:07:12.256 --> 00:07:14.909
I thought
America wouldn't join the war.

00:07:15.159 --> 00:07:18.207
I wouldn't want to be a nurse
if I knew this.

00:07:18.357 --> 00:07:21.881
I will quit if they are sending me.

00:07:22.191 --> 00:07:24.018
It is just too dangerous
to go to the front line.

00:07:24.168 --> 00:07:27.254
Moreover, we are just trainees.

00:07:27.504 --> 00:07:30.357
Yeah, we still don't have
enough experience.

00:07:30.507 --> 00:07:32.698
I don't want to upset my parents.

00:07:34.903 --> 00:07:36.664
Come here, you all.

00:07:36.914 --> 00:07:39.967
Yes.

00:07:49.318 --> 00:07:53.380
I have met you all just before
you came to this hospital.

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:55.753
I hope you all are good.

00:07:56.392 --> 00:08:00.721
I came here for a reason.

00:08:00.871 --> 00:08:06.257
The Mary Jane Nurse School is under
an order to send a nurse troop.

00:08:08.404 --> 00:08:09.837
As expected!

00:08:12.141 --> 00:08:14.702
Every famous hospital
and nursing school in America

00:08:14.852 --> 00:08:17.904
has already sent people
to the war zone.

00:08:29.425 --> 00:08:31.618
St. Joanna hospital is under an order

00:08:31.768 --> 00:08:34.321
to send five nurses to Italy.

00:08:35.064 --> 00:08:39.160
The Merry Jane Nurse School
will send one nurse to France.

00:08:40.803 --> 00:08:41.963
One?

00:08:42.438 --> 00:08:45.399
Any volunteers?

00:08:45.549 --> 00:08:47.653
I need one volunteer.

00:08:51.980 --> 00:08:53.640
Should I volunteer?

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:58.751
I remember that Doctor Michael
from the party is in France as well.

00:09:07.362 --> 00:09:09.193
I will leave you here.

00:09:10.732 --> 00:09:12.097
OK.

00:09:12.668 --> 00:09:14.395
Maybe we won't see each other again...

00:09:14.545 --> 00:09:17.701
Our duty is to help people.

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:19.707
Yes.

00:09:20.642 --> 00:09:22.166
Take care, Candy.

00:09:23.645 --> 00:09:25.442
You too, Mr. Michael.

00:09:28.617 --> 00:09:31.111
It's our duty.

00:09:31.261 --> 00:09:34.917
Yes.
I shall go to the front line and help.

00:09:35.257 --> 00:09:38.158
But once I go...

00:09:38.326 --> 00:09:40.521
I might not be able to see
everyone again.

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:44.821
Archie, Stear...

00:09:45.434 --> 00:09:47.026
Annie, Patty...

00:09:47.903 --> 00:09:49.530
Mr. Albert...

00:09:49.805 --> 00:09:54.330
And Grandfather William.

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:57.504
But this is what I choose for myself.

00:09:57.654 --> 00:10:00.574
This is the road
I should take as a nurse.

00:10:00.724 --> 00:10:03.982
Nurses are urgently needed
on the battlefield.

00:10:04.553 --> 00:10:06.250
Candy!

00:10:07.589 --> 00:10:08.916
Terry!

00:10:10.559 --> 00:10:12.322
No.

00:10:13.295 --> 00:10:16.703
I will go, I need to do this.

00:10:22.204 --> 00:10:24.069
I will go.

00:10:25.474 --> 00:10:27.339
I will go.

00:10:27.843 --> 00:10:29.174
Franny!

00:10:43.224 --> 00:10:46.193
Franny, I will send you.

00:10:46.427 --> 00:10:49.829
You all can leave,
I need to talk with her.

00:10:50.139 --> 00:10:51.395
Yes!

00:10:56.304 --> 00:11:00.035
Franny was so determined!

00:11:01.442 --> 00:11:03.436
Dim wit, are you still here?

00:11:03.786 --> 00:11:07.147
- Yes!
- Go out!

00:11:07.448 --> 00:11:10.343
No more silly things!

00:11:10.693 --> 00:11:11.912
Yes.

00:11:17.525 --> 00:11:18.952
Lucky us!

00:11:19.102 --> 00:11:20.854
If Franny didn't volunteer,

00:11:21.004 --> 00:11:23.123
it might have been one of us.

00:11:23.473 --> 00:11:26.793
If I got picked,
my parents would be upset.

00:11:26.943 --> 00:11:28.428
I am their only daughter.

00:11:28.578 --> 00:11:30.229
Franny was brave.

00:11:30.379 --> 00:11:34.000
Yeah, she did it for us.

00:11:34.150 --> 00:11:35.902
She didn't care about her family,

00:11:36.052 --> 00:11:38.104
and made the decision.

00:11:38.254 --> 00:11:41.945
I don't have parents.

00:11:42.316 --> 00:11:43.905
But Franny does.

00:11:44.055 --> 00:11:45.712
Why was I hesitating?

00:11:45.862 --> 00:11:48.519
Why didn't I volunteer?

00:11:56.998 --> 00:11:58.257
Franny!

00:11:58.407 --> 00:11:59.258
How was it?

00:11:59.408 --> 00:12:00.595
Nothing special.

00:12:00.902 --> 00:12:03.529
You are so calm!

00:12:03.679 --> 00:12:04.831
Good on you!

00:12:04.981 --> 00:12:06.806
When are you leaving?

00:12:07.275 --> 00:12:08.468
In two days' time.

00:12:08.618 --> 00:12:10.238
Two days?!

00:12:10.645 --> 00:12:13.944
That is fast!

00:12:14.348 --> 00:12:15.942
This just happened too fast.

00:12:16.092 --> 00:12:17.678
War will not wait for anyone.

00:12:18.086 --> 00:12:19.678
Right...

00:12:20.488 --> 00:12:22.382
But the war is worse than expected.

00:12:22.532 --> 00:12:24.482
The number of wounded is increasing.

00:12:25.026 --> 00:12:27.818
Many nurses sacrificed themselves.

00:12:32.667 --> 00:12:35.830
Franny,
you are on night shift today.

00:12:36.037 --> 00:12:37.766
I will swap with you.

00:12:38.306 --> 00:12:39.699
- Why?
- Because...

00:12:39.849 --> 00:12:42.235
You are leaving soon.

00:12:42.385 --> 00:12:44.070
There must be a lot of things
you need to take care of.

00:12:44.220 --> 00:12:46.973
It is fine, you don't need to worry.

00:12:47.123 --> 00:12:49.312
I will take care of myself.

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:08.632
I did the right thing.

00:13:08.836 --> 00:13:11.764
This is what nurses
are supposed to do.

00:13:11.914 --> 00:13:16.367
I don't need to discuss it
with my family.

00:13:19.146 --> 00:13:21.607
Sister Pony and sister Lane...

00:13:21.757 --> 00:13:25.511
If they would know I am going
to Europe with the troops,

00:13:25.661 --> 00:13:27.349
would they be against it?

00:13:28.756 --> 00:13:31.088
I have many people that
I want to meet.

00:13:45.506 --> 00:13:48.534
Too many, I am so greedy!

00:13:48.684 --> 00:13:49.968
Terry...

00:13:50.118 --> 00:13:53.672
I wish we could be with each other
much more.

00:13:54.081 --> 00:13:56.743
Not just for short moments.

00:14:04.792 --> 00:14:08.353
I have someone
that I can't leave behind.

00:14:08.503 --> 00:14:10.722
Franny has parents.

00:14:14.802 --> 00:14:17.032
I will go look for Franny.

00:14:23.544 --> 00:14:24.470
Why?

00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:27.573
This is just something from us.

00:14:27.723 --> 00:14:31.577
I can't take this, take it back.

00:14:31.727 --> 00:14:36.215
Franny, because of you
we don't have to go on the battlefield.

00:14:36.365 --> 00:14:39.482
You don't have to thank me.

00:14:40.093 --> 00:14:42.321
I volunteered for this.

00:14:43.171 --> 00:14:45.958
What is it? You are here
to thank me as well?

00:14:46.108 --> 00:14:48.433
No, I need to speak to you.

00:14:48.836 --> 00:14:51.930
Important things,
just the two of us.

00:14:52.873 --> 00:14:55.842
OK. We can talk outside.
Let's go!

00:15:11.391 --> 00:15:13.484
What do you want to say?

00:15:14.428 --> 00:15:15.788
I...

00:15:16.238 --> 00:15:19.024
If you have any complaints,
just say it.

00:15:19.274 --> 00:15:21.593
No, I'm not complaining, it's...

00:15:21.743 --> 00:15:23.228
What?

00:15:23.378 --> 00:15:26.568
I want to join the nurse troop.

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:28.965
Why?

00:15:29.543 --> 00:15:33.102
You have parents, family.

00:15:35.215 --> 00:15:36.374
Yes.

00:15:36.524 --> 00:15:38.577
Two older brothers,
two younger sisters,

00:15:38.727 --> 00:15:40.245
and one younger brother.

00:15:40.395 --> 00:15:43.048
Such a big family?
I should be the one going.

00:15:43.198 --> 00:15:44.382
What?

00:15:44.532 --> 00:15:45.884
You shouldn't be going
to the war zone,

00:15:46.034 --> 00:15:47.486
I should be the one going.

00:15:47.636 --> 00:15:49.788
Candy, what are you talking about?

00:15:49.938 --> 00:15:51.723
It has been decided.

00:15:51.873 --> 00:15:54.733
Why do you want to go instead of me?

00:15:55.435 --> 00:15:57.429
I am an orphan,

00:15:57.579 --> 00:15:59.731
and I have so many people that
I can't leave behind.

00:15:59.881 --> 00:16:01.800
You have parents and siblings,

00:16:01.950 --> 00:16:04.400
you must be very reluctant
to leave them behind.

00:16:06.279 --> 00:16:08.507
Are you serious?

00:16:09.883 --> 00:16:11.543
Is that what you thought?

00:16:11.693 --> 00:16:15.348
My family won't worry about me
even I go to the front line.

00:16:17.090 --> 00:16:20.491
My father gets drunk everyday
and quarrels with my mom.

00:16:20.727 --> 00:16:23.221
My brother and sister
never give a helping hand to others.

00:16:23.371 --> 00:16:25.787
Everybody lives their own lives.

00:16:27.734 --> 00:16:31.095
You think a family like that
would care anything about me?

00:16:31.245 --> 00:16:32.797
Don't be silly!

00:16:33.006 --> 00:16:36.000
And don't worry about me either.

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:37.542
But Franny...

00:16:38.311 --> 00:16:41.773
You want to go instead of me?
Just mind your own business!

00:16:41.923 --> 00:16:45.659
I told you that I hate people
who meddle in my business!

00:16:45.818 --> 00:16:49.581
No,
if anything happens to you...

00:16:49.731 --> 00:16:54.184
You mean if I'll die?

00:16:59.198 --> 00:17:02.594
I was aware of that
when I volunteered.

00:17:02.744 --> 00:17:04.696
This is my decision.

00:17:04.846 --> 00:17:07.432
Please don't try to stop me.

00:17:07.582 --> 00:17:09.839
Going to the battlefield bravely,

00:17:10.009 --> 00:17:11.806
this makes me feel more like a nurse.

00:17:27.827 --> 00:17:29.155
Franny!

00:17:40.039 --> 00:17:44.567
I can't believe
I told her about my family.

00:17:45.912 --> 00:17:48.574
I never mentioned this to anyone.

00:17:50.116 --> 00:17:53.847
This isn't right!

00:18:04.463 --> 00:18:07.193
Franny was right.

00:18:07.599 --> 00:18:11.933
We can't move on
if we always have our family in mind.

00:18:12.705 --> 00:18:15.868
Maybe I should just
take care of my own business.

00:18:16.842 --> 00:18:20.209
Am I wrong?

00:18:21.914 --> 00:18:25.542
This is my decision.

00:18:25.692 --> 00:18:28.153
Please don't stop me, Candy.

00:18:30.489 --> 00:18:31.949
Franny,

00:18:32.099 --> 00:18:36.791
I thought you were a mean person,

00:18:37.496 --> 00:18:40.897
but I have a lot to learn from you
as a nurse.

00:18:43.469 --> 00:18:46.930
Franny has a totally different
personality and thoughts than me.

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:49.439
We grew up
from different backgrounds.

00:18:49.775 --> 00:18:52.202
Although I don't have parents,

00:18:52.352 --> 00:18:54.138
when I was at Pony's Home,

00:18:54.288 --> 00:18:56.840
everyone was like family to me.

00:18:56.990 --> 00:19:01.779
Franny,
maybe we could become good friends,

00:19:01.929 --> 00:19:04.721
if only we had more time.

00:19:08.927 --> 00:19:14.559
But we will separate
in two days' time.

00:19:23.909 --> 00:19:28.788
Take care,
Judy, Natalie and Eleanor.

00:19:28.938 --> 00:19:31.608
Head nurse,
thank you for everything.

00:19:31.758 --> 00:19:33.244
Take care, Franny.

00:19:33.394 --> 00:19:35.817
- Candy!
- Yes!

00:19:36.054 --> 00:19:37.715
Thank you.

00:19:37.865 --> 00:19:41.085
Franny,
I am sorry about last night.

00:19:41.235 --> 00:19:43.594
I shouldn't have said
those things, but...

00:19:44.329 --> 00:19:48.726
Miss Candice White,
I am not going to die.

00:19:48.876 --> 00:19:53.295
Of course, we will have the chance
to be colleagues in the future.

00:19:57.843 --> 00:19:59.500
Franny...

00:19:59.650 --> 00:20:02.045
I know this is hard,
but you should be going.

00:20:04.817 --> 00:20:08.412
Although we didn't get
to understand each other better...

00:20:08.562 --> 00:20:10.682
Everyone, take care!

00:20:11.723 --> 00:20:17.423
...I still admire you, Franny.

00:20:17.729 --> 00:20:19.094
Go!

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:23.394
I just can't make myself to like her.

00:20:23.544 --> 00:20:28.031
I could never be
as cheerful and honest as her.

00:20:28.981 --> 00:20:32.440
You will definitely be a good nurse.

00:20:32.678 --> 00:20:36.375
Good bye, Candice White!

00:20:48.893 --> 00:20:53.990
Franny is heading
towards the war zone with the troops.

00:20:54.532 --> 00:20:57.861
Although they couldn't be
good friends,

00:20:58.011 --> 00:20:59.496
Candy's

00:20:59.646 --> 00:21:02.365
brief encounter with Franny

00:21:02.515 --> 00:21:06.836
has motivated her

00:21:06.986 --> 00:21:09.471
to follow and strive
for Franny's example as a nurse.
